175LU    176YB(P,2NG)                  1974WI06,1974FO01         25NDS    202511
175LU  H TYP=FUL$AUT=Jin Wu$CIT=NDS 206, 1 (2025)$CUT=29-Oct-2024$              
175LU c  1974Wi06: The excited levels of {+175}Lu were populated through the    
175LU2c  reaction {+176}Yb(p,2n) with a proton beam of energies between 6.8     
175LU3c  and 10 MeV using a self-supporting metal target of {+176}Yb (enriched  
175LU4c  to 96%) with a thickness of 0.9 mg/cm{+2}. The emitted |g rays were    
175LU5c  detected by two Ge(Li) detectors. Measured E|g, |g|g, I|g, |g|g(t).    
175LU c  1974Fo01: The excited levels of {+175}Lu were populated through the    
175LU2c  reaction {+176}Yb(p,2n) with a proton beam of energies between 14 and  
175LU3c  29 MeV using a self-supporting metal target of {+176}Yb. The emitted   
175LU4c  |g rays were detected by Ge(Li) detectors. Measured |g|g coin, p|g(t)  
