175LU5c  from the reaction were detected by the DANCE array (4|p |g-ray         
175LU6c  calorimeter made of 160 fast timing BaF{-2} scintillation crystals).   
175LU7c  Measured |g-ray energies and intensities, neutron capture cross        
175LU8c  sections. Deduced: resonance energies.                                 
