175HF  H TYP=FUL$AUT=Jin Wu$CIT=NDS 206, 1 (2025)$CUT=29-Oct-2024$              
175HF c  1980Dr06: High-spin states in {+175}Hf were populated via the          
175HF2c  {+170}Er({+9}Be,4n) reaction at a beam energy of 44 MeV, using         
175HF3c  isotopically enriched metallic targets with a thickness of 2-5         
175HF4c  mg/cm{+2}. The |g rays were detected by the high-resolution Ge(Li)     
175HF5c  and thin windowed intrinsic Ge planar detectors. Measured E|g, I|g,    
175HF6c  |g|g(t), |g(|q) and ce.                                                
175HF cG E$Uncertainties range from 0.15 keV for the strong lines, 0.35 keV     
175HF2cG for partially resolved weaker lines.                                   
175HF cG M,MR$From |g(|q) (1980Dr06).                                           
175HF cG RI$Relative I|g measured at |q=55|'.                                   
175HF cG RI(Y)$Contaminated by impurity line.                                   
175HF cG RI(Z)$Contains contamination from Ge(n,n').                            
175HF cG E(V)$Precedes 1433-keV isomer.                                         
175HF cG RI(A)$I|g(178.9|g + 179.1|g)=14.5 {I20}.                               
175HF cG RI(B)$I|g(185.8|g + 185.9|g)=21.5 {I14}.                               
175HF cG RI(D)$I|g(231.0|g + 231.1|g)=51.3 {I15}.                               
175HF cG RI(E)$I|g(274.2|g + 274.9|g + 275.1|g)=82.3 {I27}.                     
175HF cG RI(F)$I|g(358.0|g + 358.4|g)=48.9 {I13}.                               
175HF cG RI(G)$I|g(522.5|g + 523.1|g)=12.9 {I7}.                                
175HF cG RI(H)$I|g(535.3|g + 535.7|g + 536.6|g)=18.6 {I24}.                     
175HF cG RI(I)$I|g(593.6|g + 595.5|g + 596.0|g)=8.1 {I3}.                       
175HF cG RI(L)$Authors quote <3.6 {I6}.                                         
175HF cL E$From a least-squares fit to E|g, by evaluator assuming |DE=1.0 keV   
175HF2cL for integer values, and |DE=0.5 keV for one-decimal-digit values.      
175HF CL BAND(A)$5/2-[512] band.                                                
175HF CL BAND(B)$1/2-[521] band.                                                
175HF CL BAND(C)$7/2+[633] band.                                                
175HF CL BAND(D)$K{+|p}=19/2+ band. 3-quasiparticle intrinsic band,             
175HF2cL |n7/2+[633] coupled to |p{+2} 5/2+[402]~#7/2+[404] (1549-keV {+174}Hf  
175HF3cL state).                                                                
175HF CL BAND(E)$K{+|p}=23/2- band. 3-quasiparticle intrinsic band,             
175HF2cL |n7/2+[633] coupled to |p{+2} 7/2+[404]~#9/2-[514] (1797-keV {+174}Hf  
175HF3cL state).                                                                
