175OS cN $In 1992Sc16, {+175}Ir (%|e+%|b{++}) feeding to the {+175}Os levels    
175OS2cN is shown at 504.4 keV level and at an unspecified level above the      
175OS3cN 105.4 keV as 22% {I1} and 73% {I5} respectively and |a Branching to    
175OS4cN {+171}Re as <5% {I1}. These values need revision with more             
175OS5cN experimental data and evaluator does not present the feedings in this  
175OS6cN dataset.                                                               
