175OS    179PT A DECAY                 2021Ha32,1982BO04,1979HA1025NDS    202511
175OS  H TYP=FUL$AUT=Jin Wu$CIT=NDS 206, 1 (2025)$CUT=29-Oct-2024$              
175OS c  2021Ha32: The parent {+179}Pt was produced by the spallation of        
175OS2c  UC{-x} target induced with the the E=1.4 GeV protons. The ions of      
175OS3c  interest were implanted in the Windmil decay station at CERN.          
